namespace K2Node_CreateDreamWidget

NodeTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIK2Nodes/Private/K2Node_CreateDreamWidget.cpp
    src   "Creates a DreamUI widget, off screen until it is added somewhere (Add to Viewport, Add Child).\nThe class's Expose on Spawn properties -- every prop of a .dui file -- are set before the widget initializes, so Pre Construct, On Initialized and its bindings already see them."
    text  "创建一个 DreamUI 控件，在添加到某处（添加到视口、添加子项）之前一直处于屏幕外。\n该类的 Expose on Spawn 属性（.dui 文件的每个 prop）在控件初始化之前就已设置好，因此 Pre Construct、On Initialized 及其绑定都已经能读到它们。"
    state machine
}

